    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Two AKU-SONAM alumni, Ms Mary Najjuma and Ms Harriet Nayiga were selected as \"Star Nurses and Midwives\" by Nursing Now Uganda. They were two of four nurses who were celebrated for their immense contributions to nursing and midwifery in the country.",
